><title><![CDATA[20 years in making: LeBron and Bronny James create NBA playoff history with first father-son alley-oop]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130522350.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[LeBron James and Bronny James made NBA playoff history with the league’s first father-son scoring connection, as LeBron set up an alley-oop finished by Bronny in Game 3 against the Houston Rockets. Beyond the highlight, the moment underscored LeBron’s unmatched longevity, allowing their careers to overlap in a meaningful, competitive playoff setting rather than a symbolic appearance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/international-sports/20-years-in-making-lebron-and-bronny-james-create-nba-playoff-history-with-first-father-son-alley-oop/articleshow/130522350.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/international-sports/20-years-in-making-lebron-and-bronny-james-create-nba-playoff-history-with-first-father-son-alley-oop/articleshow/130522350.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-26T02:05:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130522802,imgsize-147456.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘India has challenges but…’: Ex-Microsoft professional quits ‘American Dream’ amid visa problems]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130522478.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/india-has-its-challenges-but-ex-microsoft-professional-quits-the-american-dream-amid-visa-uncertainty/articleshow/130522478.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/india-has-its-challenges-but-ex-microsoft-profe